        "payload": "tree 498b48bbb439f80d6a93595e693fb172105454b0\nparent 6799119cef7ead71e2b2fc7928a0ea58d720c708\nauthor stickies-v <stickies-v@protonmail.com> 1792490025 +0200\ncommitter stickies-v <stickies-v@protonmail.com> 1792490266 +0200\n\nsubprocess: fix command line memory leak on Windows\n\nPopen::execute_process() copied the command line into a buffer from\nnew[], but did not delete it. This leaked memory each time a process\nstarted on Windows.\n\nCreateProcessA needs a writable command line buffer. Since C++17,\nstd::string::data() supplies one, so give the std::string buffer\ndirectly and remove the copy.\n",
